* [`mf.gl2.history.theta`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Modular-forms/Modular-forms-miscellaneous/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_mf___gl2___history___theta_FLQQ_--statement) — Theta functions. Difficulty: hard, theory. *Blocked by:* The weighted theta series Θ\_\{L;Q;h\}, and the modularity of lattice theta series through Poisson summation (lattice.theta's gap). Declarations (Tau Ceti · Mathlib): `ZLattice.thetaSeries`, `jacobiTheta_S_smul`, `Real.tsum_eq_tsum_fourier_of_rpow_decay`, `fourier_gaussian_pi`. Note: Done: Mathlib has Poisson summation ('Real.tsum\_eq\_tsum\_fourier\_of\_rpow\_decay'), the Fourier transform of the Gaussian ('fourier\_gaussian\_pi') and the modularity of the one-variable θ ('jacobiTheta\_S\_smul'); Tau Ceti main has Θ\_L for h = 1 ('ZLattice.thetaSeries').

